  "notes": "MEDICAL TERMS:\n- {処方箋|しょほうせん}: prescription (document)\n- {処方薬|しょほうやく}: prescription medicine\n- {院外処方|いんがいしょほう}: out-of-hospital prescription\n- {院内処方|いんないしょほう}: in-hospital pharmacy\n\nJAPANESE HEALTHCARE:\nIn Japan, prescriptions ({処方箋|しょほうせん}) are often filled at pharmacies separate from the hospital ({院外処方|いんがいしょほう}), though some hospitals have internal pharmacies.\n\nVERB USAGE:\n- {処方|しょほう}する: to prescribe\n- {処方|しょほう}を{受|う}ける: to receive a prescription",
